# Next.js (`web/`) conventions

- Use App Router patterns: server components by default, client components only when needed (`"use client"`).
- Put shared UI in `web/src/components/` and feature-specific code in `web/src/app/(...)` route groups when it grows.
- Prefer `fetch` on the server and pass data down; don’t overuse client-side data fetching.
- Keep SEO-friendly metadata using Next.js `metadata` where appropriate.

